type: dataset
title: "Oligonucleotide Regulatory Requirements Graph"
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-10-28"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Hakimeh"
    given-names: "Dani"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3368-0121"
keywords:
  - oligonucleotide therapeutics
  - antisense oligonucleotide
  - siRNA
  - regulatory science
  - paediatric investigation plan
  - knowledge graph
abstract: >-
  An open, machine-readable map of laws, guidelines, pharmacopoeial texts and
  regulatory programmes that apply to oligonucleotide therapeutics across the
  development path (ICH, EU, US, Japan, UK). Nodes carry scope, an
  oligonucleotide-specific note and a confidence level; edges link documents to
  development milestones, oligo-specific considerations and each other.
